cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "YouTube Guitar Playa Companion"
abstract: >-
  A Chrome extension for learning songs on YouTube: A/B looping,
  pitch-preserving speed control from 25% to 500%, a speed trainer,
  a metronome with automatic BPM detection, saved videos and loops,
  a Markdown editor for practice notes with a built-in guitar tab editor, and a
  scale library for guitar and bass with a circle of fifths and
  CAGED chord shapes, and a song editor with editable chord shapes.
authors:
  - given-names: John L.
    family-names: Whiteman
repository-code: "https://github.com/johnlwhiteman/guitar-playa-youtube-companion"
url: "https://github.com/johnlwhiteman/guitar-playa-youtube-companion"
license: MIT
version: 1.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-25"
